    { name = 'Blue Magic teachers', group = 'Server', desc = 'Lists the monster family or NM that teaches each Blue Magic spell on Scythe, with cost and timing data. Source: https://scythe-bbq.pages.dev/blue-magic.html', steps = { { title = 'How learning works', note = '• Catalog: 196 spells (184 from regular families, 12 from NMs), over 70 mob families.\n• Base Set Points are 20; equipment can add more.\n• BLU is open from character creation.\n• Have BLU as your main job; spells cannot be learned while it is a subjob.\n• Fight a member of the listed family in any zone suited to your level; retail locations apply.\n• Let its TP move land on you (an AoE that resolves on you counts); a resist or miss does not stop learning.\n• Defeat the mob or leave the zone to get the learn roll; success shows "You learned [spell]!" and may take several fights.\n• Equip new spells via Magic → Set Spells; each costs Set Points.' }, { title = 'Spells from mob families (1 of 3)', note = '• Format: spell: teacher family (element, MP cost, cast/recast seconds). Sub-variants of a family (e.g. Wyvern → Guivre, Simorg, Seiryu) teach the same spell; all retail zones are open on Scythe, see BG-Wiki for spots.\n• 1000 Needles: Sabotender (Light, 350 MP, 12.0s/56s)\n• Acrid Stream: Clionid (Water, 89 MP, 3.0s/23s)\n• Actinic Burst: Ghrah (Light, 24 MP, 0.5s/60s)\n• Amplification: Flan (Physical, 48 MP, 4.0s/56s)\n• Animating Wail: Qutrub (Wind, 53 MP, 2.0s/45s)\n• Amorphic Spikes: Flan (Physical, 79 MP, 0.5s/58s)\n• Asuran Claws: Gnole (Physical, 81 MP, 2.0s/60s)\n• Auroral Drape: Weeper (Wind, 51 MP, 4.0s/60s)\n• Awful Eye: Bugard (Water, 32 MP, 2.5s/60s)\n• Bad Breath: Morbol (Earth, 212 MP, 8.75s/56s)\n• Barbed Crescent: Fomor / Shadow (Physical, 52 MP, 0.5s/22s)\n• Barrier Tusk: Marid / IrizIma (Earth, 41 MP, 6.0s/60s)\n• Battle Dance: Orc / Mimic (Physical, 12 MP, 1.0s/10s)\n• Battery Charge: Magic Pot (Light, 50 MP, 5.0s/75s)\n• Benthic Typhoon: Murex (Physical, 56 MP, 0.5s/48s)\n• Blank 